                                                "sense_id": "6aef08ec-251b-3001-81f1-57512947c06f",
                                                "text": "The prosecutor offered the lieutenant immunity for all the crimes he would testify having known to be planned by the elusive drug baron."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d32cfa04-bbe6-382e-a6ff-2b34d09540c5",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being insusceptible to something; notably:",
                                            "An exemption from penance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38abbfb2-189a-432f-a5fb-f23411eb9920",
                                                "sense_id": "d32cfa04-bbe6-382e-a6ff-2b34d09540c5",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, his reason rebelled, and his sense of religion by no means allowed the justice of refusing the amiable, handsome, and wealthy Englishman, whom his sweet child preferred, and who was perfectly willing that the signora should enjoy all the liberty required by her conscience and her church, together with such sums as should, from time to time, purchase the prayers of the faithful, and all other immunities, so far as his fortune furnished the means."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
